<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bond exchange auction totals 2.930 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian bond exchange auction totals 2.930 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury's bond exchange auction totalled 2.930 billion francs, the Treasury said in a statement  BELE.</p>
<p>At the auction, participants could exchange OLO 22 (7.50 pct, Jan 1997) into one-, four-, five-, eight- and nine-year paper. The Treasury said the only offers received and accepted were for OLO 11 (9.00 pct, July 1998).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
